{
  "message": "I’m here to help you get your mobile data working at the best possible speed! To start, I’ll guide you step by step. First, I need to check your phone’s network settings. Please set your network mode to prefer 4G/5G. This will allow your phone to connect to the fastest available network.

Can you please perform the following action on your phone:

- Set your network mode preference to 4G/5G (the option may be called "4G/5G Preferred" or similar in your settings).

Let me know once you’ve done this, or if you need help finding the option."
}

{
