Next, if you are traveling or outside your usual area, you may need to enable data roaming to get the best connection. Please enable data roaming on your phone now.

Let me know once you’ve done this, or if you need help finding the data roaming option."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for following the steps! You’ve now set your phone to use the fastest available network and enabled data roaming, which are the best settings for excellent internet speed.\n\nIf you still experience slow or unreliable internet, please let me know. I can guide you through a few more checks, such as making sure mobile data is enabled, checking for data saver mode, or running a speed test. Just let me know if you want to continue troubleshooting or if your internet is working better now!"
}

{
  "message": "I'm so glad to hear your internet connection is now excellent and fast! You're very welcome—I'm always here to help if you need anything else. Have a great day and enjoy your improved mobile data!"
}

{
  "message": "I can help you troubleshoot your mobile data issue while you are abroad. To get started, I need to identify your account. Could you please provide your phone number, customer ID, or your full name and date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for providing your information, John. To help improve your mobile data speed while abroad, I’ll need you to perform a few actions on your phone. First, please set your network mode preference to '4G/5G Preferred' to ensure you are connecting to the fastest available network. Let me know once you have done this, and I’ll guide you through the next steps."
}

{
  "message": "Great! Next, please disconnect from any active VPN on your phone. VPNs can sometimes slow down your internet connection, especially when you are abroad. Once you have disconnected the VPN, let me know so I can guide you to the next step."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you! Now, please enable data roaming on your phone. This will allow your device to use mobile data networks while you are abroad. Once you have enabled data roaming, let me know if your internet speed improves or if you still need further assistance."
}

{
  "message": "I'm glad to hear that your internet speed is now excellent and your issue is resolved! If you need any further assistance in the future, feel free to reach out. Have a great time in France!"
}

{
  "message": "I can help you with your MMS issue. First, I need to verify your identity to access your account and provide support. Could you please provide either your phone number, customer ID, or your full name along with your date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for verifying your information, John. To help resolve your MMS issue, I’ll need to guide you through a few troubleshooting steps. First, please turn off Wi-Fi Calling on your phone. You can do this by running the action: toggle_wifi_calling(). Let me know once you’ve done this, or if you need instructions on how to proceed."
}

{
  "message": "Great, thank you. Next, please reset your APN settings to ensure your phone has the correct configuration for MMS. You can do this by running the action: reset_apn_settings(). Let me know once you’ve completed this step."
}

{
  "message": "Perfect. Now, please reboot your device to apply the new APN settings. You can do this by running the action: reboot_device(). Let me know once your phone has restarted."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for rebooting your device. Next, let's make sure your messaging app has the necessary permissions to send MMS. Please grant SMS permission to your messaging app by running the action: grant_app_permission(app_name=messaging, permission=sms). Let me know once this is done."
}

{
  "message": "Great! Now, please also grant storage permission to your messaging app. This is necessary for sending and receiving MMS with media files. Please run the action: grant_app_permission(app_name=messaging, permission=storage). Let me know once this is complete."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for granting the necessary permissions. Now, please ensure that your mobile data is turned ON, as MMS requires an active mobile data connection. Please run the action: toggle_data() to enable mobile data if it is not already on. Let me know once this is done."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for completing all the steps. Please try sending an MMS message now to see if the issue is resolved. If you are still unable to send MMS, let me know and I will assist you with further troubleshooting."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for letting me know. Since the basic troubleshooting steps have not resolved the issue, let's check if your phone's data roaming is enabled, as this can affect MMS if you are outside your home network. Please enable data roaming on your phone by running the action: toggle_roaming(). Let me know once this is done."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for enabling data roaming on your phone. I have now enabled roaming on your line as well. Please try sending an MMS message again. If it still does not work, let me know and we can continue troubleshooting."
}

